        "\n",
        "        <div class=\"lesson-body\">\n",
        "          <h2 id=\"task-centered-introduction\">Task-Centered Introduction</h2>\n",
        "          <p>Welcome to the <strong>Open Coding Society</strong> — where you’ll develop professional software engineering skills while building real projects with your classmates.</p>\n",
        "\n",
        "          <h3 id=\"the-challenge\">The Challenge</h3>\n",
        "          <p>Starting a new development environment can be overwhelming. You will encounter unfamiliar tools, new workflows, new teammates, and problems that do not always have obvious answers.</p>\n",
        "\n",
        "          <p><strong>This is your first challenge: learn to work in an unfamiliar development environment.</strong></p>\n",
        "\n",
        "          <h3 id=\"the-problem\">The Problem</h3>\n",
        "          <p>New developers often feel overwhelmed by unfamiliar tools, workflows, technologies, and expectations.</p>\n",
        "\n",
        "          <h3 id=\"the-goal\">The Goal</h3>\n",
        "          <ul>\n",
        "            <li>Build your personal portfolio.</li>\n",
        "            <li>Set up your development workflow.</li>\n",
        "            <li>Document your work.</li>\n",
        "            <li>Begin your project work.</li>\n",
        "          </ul>\n",
        "\n",
        "          <h2 id=\"activation--you-already-know-more-than-you-think\">Activation — You Already Know More Than You Think</h2>\n",
        "          <p>You are not starting from zero.</p>\n",
        "\n",
        "          <h2 id=\"onboarding-objectives---ground-0\">Onboarding Objectives - Ground 0</h2>\n",
        "          <ul class=\"task-list\">\n",
        "            <li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled />I understand the challenge.</li>\n",
        "            <li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled />I can use my development environment.</li>\n",
        "            <li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled />I can commit and push to GitHub.</li>\n",
        "            <li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled />I can work with my team.</li>\n",
        "            <li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled />I can begin project work.</li>\n",
        "          </ul>\n",
        "        </div>\n",
        "      </div>\n",
        "    </div>\n",
        "  </div>\n",
        "</div>\n",
        "\n",
        "<script>\n",
        "  window.toggleSprint = function (sprintId) {\n",
        "    const lessons = document.getElementById(`sprint-${sprintId}-lessons`);\n",
        "    const chevron = document.getElementById(`chevron-${sprintId}`);\n",
        "    if (!lessons || !chevron) return;\n",
        "    const isHidden = lessons.style.display === 'none';\n",
        "    lessons.style.display = isHidden ? 'block' : 'none';\n",
        "    chevron.classList.toggle('fa-chevron-right', !isHidden);\n",
        "    chevron.classList.toggle('fa-chevron-down', isHidden);\n",
        "  };\n",
        "\n",
        "  function getCompletionData() {\n",
        "    try {\n",
        "      return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('csp-lesson-completion') || '{}');\n",
        "    } catch {\n",
        "      return {};\n",
        "    }\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  function syncCompletionUI() {\n",
        "    const data = getCompletionData();\n",
        "    const isCompleted = !!data['/sprint1/challenge/csp/'];\n",
        "    const icon = document.getElementById('complete-icon-topbar');\n",
        "    const text = document.getElementById('complete-text-topbar');\n",
        "    if (icon && text) {\n",
        "      icon.classList.toggle('fa-circle', !isCompleted);\n",
        "      icon.classList.toggle('fa-circle-check', isCompleted);\n",
        "      text.textContent = isCompleted ? 'Completed' : 'Burndown';\n",
        "    }\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  window.toggleComplete = function () {\n",
        "    const key = '/sprint1/challenge/csp/';\n",
        "    const data = getCompletionData();\n",
        "    data[key] = !data[key];\n",
        "    localStorage.setItem('csp-lesson-completion', JSON.stringify(data));\n",
        "    syncCompletionUI();\n",
        "  };\n",
        "\n",
        "  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', syncCompletionUI);\n",
        \"</script>\n"
      ]
    }
